# Response handling.

### Compressed: the status bar shows both sizes
GET {{baseUrl}}/html

### Ask for zstd only
GET {{baseUrl}}/get
Accept-Encoding: zstd

### No compression
GET {{baseUrl}}/get
Accept-Encoding: identity

### Binary
GET {{baseUrl}}/bytes/64

### Slow, cancel it from the send button
GET {{baseUrl}}/delay/5
